      "title": "Humming of Rusted Strings",
      "premise": "As a scavenger, what I stumbled upon was a radio signal from \"Dawn Radio\"—a broadcast reaching out from a world long dead. Worrying about the dwindling life of my last few batteries, I venture into the ruins of the former capital, chasing the music through the static. What awaits me there is the phantom of a \"Festival Night\"—a celebration once held by humanity amidst the depths of despair. In a world devoid of both resources and hope, broken machines and human tenacity play one final melody."
    },
